LabelUnenumerable = Empty bins were not added: "%s" is a free-text/number level with no filter value, so its bins cannot be enumerated. Set a value in its filter to enumerate below it.
LabelEnumTruncated = Empty-bin enumeration stopped at %s — narrow the selection with the level filters.
